        "TileImage": "$($repository 42e7d00a-b477-4c4f-8b13-8cd4e7403e0d).Image",
        "Description": "Good Afternoon, 47.\r\rYour targets are three individuals whom our client suspects have taken part in a cover-up operation for a certain assassin.\r\rThe assassin in question has an unknown identity, but it is suspected that the individual was personally responsible for multiple mass murders that have occured recently throughout the world.\r\rOur client has requested that we investigate the targets&apos; areas for any evidence that may have remained. Importantly, this must be taken out completely silently.",
